#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.constraint_l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt_code_uniq
msgid "The VATEX tax exempt code has to be unique!"
msgstr "VATEX oznaka izuzeća od poreza mora biti jedinstvena!"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1Q
msgid ""
"The activities, other than those of a commercial nature, carried out by "
"public radio and television bodies."
msgstr "Djelatnosti, osim onih komercijalne naravi, koje obavljaju tijela javne radiotelevizije."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1B
msgid ""
"The final importation of goods governed by Council Directives 69/169/EEC "
"(1), 83/181/EEC (2) and 2006/79/EC (3)."
msgstr "Konačni uvoz dobara uređen Direktivama Vijeća 69/169/EEZ (1), 83/181/EEZ (2) i 2006/79/EZ (3)."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1A
msgid ""
"The final importation of goods of which the supply by a taxable person "
"would in all circumstances be exempt within their respective territory."
msgstr "Konačni uvoz dobara čija bi isporuka od strane poreznog obveznika bila u svim okolnostima izuzeta na njihovom području."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1C
msgid ""
"The final importation of goods, in free circulation from a third territory "
"forming part of the Community customs territory, which would be entitled to "
"exemption under point (b) if they had been imported within the meaning of "
"the first paragraph of Article 30"
msgstr "Konačni uvoz dobara, u slobodnom prometu s trećeg područja koje čini dio carinskog područja Zajednice, koja bi imala pravo na izuzeće prema točki (b) da su uvezena u smislu prvog stavka članka 30."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1J
msgid ""
"The importation into ports, by sea fishing undertakings, of their catches, "
"unprocessed or after undergoing preservation for marketing but before being "
"supplied."
msgstr "Uvoz u luke, od strane poduzeća za morski ribolov, njihovog ulova, neprerađenog ili nakon konzerviranja za tržište, ali prije isporuke."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1L
msgid ""
"The importation of gas through a natural gas system or any network "
"connected to such a system or fed in from a vessel transporting gas into a "
"natural gas system or any upstream pipeline network, of electricity or of "
"heat or cooling energy through heating or cooling networks."
msgstr "Uvoz plina putem sustava prirodnog plina ili bilo koje mreže povezane s takvim sustavom ili unesene iz plovila koje prevozi plin u sustav prirodnog plina ili bilo koju uzvodnu plinovodnu mrežu, električne energije ili toplinske ili rashladne energije putem mreža grijanja ili hlađenja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1K
msgid "The importation of gold by central banks."
msgstr "Uvoz zlata od strane središnjih banaka."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1I
msgid ""
"The importation of goods by the armed forces of the United Kingdom "
"stationed in the island of Cyprus pursuant to the Treaty of Establishment "
"concerning the Republic of Cyprus, dated 16 August 1960, which are for the "
"use of those forces or the civilian staff accompanying them or for "
"supplying their messes or canteens."
msgstr "Uvoz dobara od strane oružanih snaga Ujedinjene Kraljevine stacioniranih na otoku Cipru u skladu s Ugovorom o osnivanju koji se odnosi na Republiku Cipar, od 16. kolovoza 1960., koja su za uporabu tih snaga ili civilnog osoblja koje ih prati ili za opskrbu njihovih kantina ili menza."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1D
msgid ""
"The importation of goods dispatched or transported from a third territory "
"or a third country into a Member State other than that in which the "
"dispatch or transport of the goods ends, where the supply of such goods by "
"the importer designated or recognised under Article 201 as liable for "
"payment of VAT is exempt under Article 138."
msgstr "Uvoz dobara otpremljenih ili prevezenih s trećeg područja ili treće zemlje u državu članicu koja nije ona u kojoj završava otprema ili prijevoz dobara, gdje je isporuka takvih dobara od strane uvoznika određenog ili priznatog prema članku 201. kao obveznika plaćanja PDV-a, izuzeta prema članku 138."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1H
msgid ""
"The importation of goods, into Member States party to the North Atlantic "
"Treaty, by the armed forces of other States party to that Treaty for the "
"use of those forces or the civilian staff accompanying them or for "
"supplying their messes or canteens where such forces take part in the "
"common defence effort."
msgstr "Uvoz dobara, u države članice stranke Sjevernoatlantskog ugovora, od strane oružanih snaga drugih država stranaka tog Ugovora za uporabu tih snaga ili civilnog osoblja koje ih prati ili za opskrbu njihovih kantina ili menza, kada takve snage sudjeluju u zajedničkim obrambenim naporima."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1F
msgid ""
"The importation, under diplomatic and consular arrangements, of goods which "
"are exempt from customs duties."
msgstr "Uvoz dobara, prema diplomatskim i konzularnim aranžmanima, koja su izuzeta od carinskih davanja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1C
msgid ""
"The provision of medical care in the exercise of the medical and "
"paramedical professions as defined by the Member State concerned."
msgstr "Pružanje medicinske skrbi u obavljanju liječničke i paramedicinske profesije kako je definirana od strane dotične države članice."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_143_1E
msgid ""
"The reimportation, by the person who exported them, of goods in the state "
"in which they were exported, where those goods are exempt from customs "
"duties."
msgstr "Ponovni uvoz, od strane osobe koja ih je izvezla, dobara u stanju u kojem su izvezena, gdje su ta dobra izuzeta od carinskih davanja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1A
msgid ""
"The supply by the public postal services of services other than passenger "
"transport and telecommunications services, and the supply of goods "
"incidental thereto."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga javnih poštanskih službi, osim prijevoza putnika i telekomunikacijskih usluga, te isporuka dobara usputno povezanih s tim."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1N
msgid ""
"The supply of certain cultural services, and the supply of goods closely "
"linked thereto, by bodies governed by public law or by other cultural "
"bodies recognised by the Member State concerned."
msgstr "Isporuka određenih kulturnih usluga, i isporuka dobara usko povezanih s tim, od strane tijela kojima upravlja javno pravo ili od strane drugih kulturnih tijela koje je dotična država članica priznala."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1M
msgid ""
"The supply of certain services closely linked to sport or physical "
"education by non-profit-making organisations to persons taking part in "
"sport or physical education."
msgstr "Isporuka određenih usluga usko povezanih sa sportom ili tjelesnim odgojem od strane neprofitnih organizacija osobama koje se bave sportom ili tjelesnim odgojem."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1D
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services to another Member State, intended for the "
"armed forces of any State which is a party to the North Atlantic Treaty, "
"other than the Member State of destination itself, for the use of those "
"forces, or of the civilian staff accompanying them, or for supplying their "
"messes or canteens when such forces take part in the common defence effort."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga drugoj državi članici, namijenjena oružanim snagama bilo koje države stranke Sjevernoatlantskog ugovora, osim same države članice odredišta, za uporabu tih snaga, ili civilnog osoblja koje ih prati, ili za opskrbu njihovih kantina ili menza kada takve snage sudjeluju u zajedničkim obrambenim naporima."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1B
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services to international bodies, other than those "
"referred to in point (aa), recognised as such by the public authorities of "
"the host Member States, and to members of such bodies, within the limits "
"and under the conditions laid down by the international conventions "
"establishing the bodies or by headquarters agreements."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga međunarodnim tijelima, osim onih navedenih u točki (aa), koja su kao takva priznata od strane javnih vlasti država članica domaćina, i članovima tih tijela, u granicama i pod uvjetima utvrđenim međunarodnim konvencijama o osnivanju tih tijela ili sporazumima o sjedištu."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1AA
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services to the European Community, the European "
"Atomic Energy Community, the European Central Bank or the European "
"Investment Bank, or to the bodies set up by the Communities to which the "
"Protocol of 8 April 1965 on the privileges and immunities of the European "
"Communities applies, within the limits and under the conditions of that "
"Protocol and the agreements for its implementation or the headquarters "
"agreements, in so far as it does not lead to distortion of competition."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga Europskoj zajednici, Europskoj zajednici za atomsku energiju, Europskoj središnjoj banci ili Europskoj investicijskoj banci, ili tijelima osnovanim od strane Zajednica na koje se primjenjuje Protokol od 8. travnja 1965. o povlasticama i imunitetima Europskih zajednica, u granicama i pod uvjetima tog Protokola i sporazuma za njegovu provedbu ili sporazuma o sjedištu, u mjeri u kojoj ne dovodi do narušavanja tržišnog natjecanja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1E
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services to the armed forces of the United Kingdom "
"stationed in the island of Cyprus pursuant to the Treaty of Establishment "
"concerning the Republic of Cyprus, dated 16 August 1960, which are for the "
"use of those forces, or of the civilian staff accompanying them, or for "
"supplying their messes or canteens."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga oružanim snagama Ujedinjene Kraljevine stacioniranim na otoku Cipru u skladu s Ugovorom o osnivanju koji se odnosi na Republiku Cipar, od 16. kolovoza 1960., koja su za uporabu tih snaga, ili civilnog osoblja koje ih prati, ili za opskrbu njihovih kantina ili menza."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1A
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services under diplomatic and consular arrangements."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga prema diplomatskim i konzularnim aranžmanima."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_151_1C
msgid ""
"The supply of goods or services within a Member State which is a party to "
"the North Atlantic Treaty, intended either for the armed forces of other "
"States party to that Treaty for the use of those forces, or of the civilian "
"staff accompanying them, or for supplying their messes or canteens when "
"such forces take part in the common defence effort."
msgstr "Isporuka dobara ili usluga unutar države članice koja je stranka Sjevernoatlantskog ugovora, namijenjena ili oružanim snagama drugih država stranaka tog Ugovora za uporabu tih snaga, ili civilnog osoblja koje ih prati, ili za opskrbu njihovih kantina ili menza kada takve snage sudjeluju u zajedničkim obrambenim naporima."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1D
msgid "The supply of human organs, blood and milk."
msgstr "Isporuka ljudskih organa, krvi i mlijeka."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1G
msgid ""
"The supply of services and of goods closely linked to welfare and social "
"security work, including those supplied by old people's homes, by bodies "
"governed by public law or by other bodies recognised by the Member State "
"concerned as being devoted to social wellbeing."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga i dobara usko povezanih s radom socijalne skrbi i socijalnog osiguranja, uključujući one koje isporučuju domovi za starije osobe, od strane tijela kojima upravlja javno pravo ili od strane drugih tijela koje je dotična država članica priznala da su posvećene socijalnoj skrbi."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1E
msgid ""
"The supply of services by dental technicians in their professional capacity "
"and the supply of dental prostheses by dentists and dental technicians."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga od strane zubotehničara u njihovom profesionalnom svojstvu i isporuka zubnih proteza od strane stomatologa i zubotehničara."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1F
msgid ""
"The supply of services by independent groups of persons, who are carrying "
"on an activity which is exempt from VAT or in relation to which they are "
"not taxable persons, for the purpose of rendering their members the "
"services directly necessary for the exercise of that activity, where those "
"groups merely claim from their members exact reimbursement of their share "
"of the joint expenses, provided that such exemption is not likely to cause "
"distortion of competition."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga od strane neovisnih skupina osoba koje obavljaju djelatnost koja je izuzeta od PDV-a ili u vezi s kojom nisu porezni obveznici, s ciljem pružanja svojim članovima usluga izravno potrebnih za obavljanje te djelatnosti, pri čemu te skupine samo traže od svojih članova točnu nadoknadu njihovog udjela u zajedničkim troškovima, pod uvjetom da takvo izuzeće vjerojatno neće uzrokovati narušavanje tržišnog natjecanja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1L
msgid ""
"The supply of services, and the supply of goods closely linked thereto, to "
"their members in their common interest in return for a subscription fixed "
"in accordance with their rules by non-profitmaking organisations with aims "
"of a political, trade-union, religious, patriotic, philosophical, "
"philanthropic or civic nature, provided that this exemption is not likely "
"to cause distortion of competition."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga, i isporuka dobara usko povezanih s tim, svojim članovima u njihovom zajedničkom interesu u zamjenu za članarinu utvrđenu u skladu s njihovim pravilima od strane neprofitnih organizacija s ciljevima političke, sindikalne, vjerske, domoljubne, filozofske, filantropske ili građanske prirode, pod uvjetom da ovo izuzeće vjerojatno neće uzrokovati narušavanje tržišnog natjecanja."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1K
msgid ""
"The supply of staff by religious or philosophical institutions for the "
"purpose of the activities referred to in points (b), (g), (h) and (i) and "
"with a view to spiritual welfare."
msgstr "Isporuka osoblja od strane vjerskih ili filozofskih institucija u svrhu aktivnosti navedenih u točkama (b), (g), (h) i (i) i u svrhu duhovne skrbi."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1P
msgid ""
"The supply of transport services for sick or injured persons in vehicles "
"specially designed for the purpose, by duly authorised bodies."
msgstr "Isporuka usluga prijevoza za bolesne ili ozlijeđene osobe u vozilima posebno dizajniranim za tu svrhu, od strane propisno ovlaštenih tijela."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,name:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_D
msgid "Travel agents VAT scheme."
msgstr "Shema PDV-a za turističke agencije."


#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_309
msgid "Travel agents performed outside of EU."
msgstr "Usluge putničkih agencija obavljene izvan EU."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_132_1J
msgid ""
"Tuition given privately by teachers and covering school or university "
"education."
msgstr "Podučavanje koje privatno daju nastavnici i koje obuhvaća školsko ili sveučilišno obrazovanje."

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.field_account_tax__l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt_form_view
msgid "VATEX Tax Exempt"
msgstr "VATEX izuzeće od poreza"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.l10n_hr_menu_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt_tree_view
msgid "VATEX Tax Exempts"
msgstr "VATEX izuzeća od poreza"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt_action
msgid "VATEX Tex Exempt"
msgstr "VATEX izuzeće od poreza"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.field_l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt__website_message_ids
msgid "Website Messages"
msgstr "Poruke web stranice"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.field_l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt__website_message_ids
msgid "Website communication history"
msgstr "Povijest komunikacije web stranice"

#. module: l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt
#: model:l10n.hr.vatex.tax.exempt,name:l10n_hr_vatex_tax_exempt.tax_exempt_VATEX_EU_I
msgid "Works of art VAT scheme."
msgstr ""
"Shema PDV-a za umjetnička djela."